{"desc": "This Pattern was posted by UserNameSekhar. Tagged with: pattern, dark, blue, white, abstract, patterned, maze, random, irregular.", "image": "/data/library-cache/files/abd45231e7cd9878a55a.jpg", "tailwind": false, "html": "<div class=\"stippled-bg\"></div>\n\n<svg width=\"0\" height=\"0\">\n  <filter id=\"stippled\">\n    <feTurbulence\n      type=\"fractalNoise\"\n      baseFrequency=\"0.1\"\n      numOctaves=\"1\"\n      seed=\"15\"\n      result=\"noise\"\n    ></feTurbulence>\n\n    <feColorMatrix\n      type=\"luminanceToAlpha\"\n      in=\"noise\"\n      result=\"alphaNoise\"\n    ></feColorMatrix>\n\n    <feComponentTransfer in=\"alphaNoise\" result=\"dots\">\n      <feFuncA type=\"discrete\" tableValues=\"0 1\"></feFuncA>\n    </feComponentTransfer>\n\n    <feFlood flood-color=\"#2c3e50\" result=\"dotColor\"></feFlood>\n\n    <feComposite operator=\"in\" in=\"dotColor\" in2=\"dots\"></feComposite>\n  </filter>\n</svg>\n", "css": ".stippled-bg {\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 100%;\n  background-color: #ecf0f1;\n  filter: url(#stippled);\n}\n", "license": "mit"}